{"id":"660865","name":"红烧肉","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/660865/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大肉","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"保元汤","amount":"|碗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好调料。","img":"images/660865/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"山楂，干辣椒，生姜切成小丁备用。","img":"images/660865/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大肉切块备用。","img":"images/660865/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里烧开水。","img":"images/660865/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下大肉开水焯水。","img":"images/660865/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出备用。","img":"images/660865/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"另起锅放油少许，把冰糖及调料先炒一下。","img":"images/660865/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放大葱炒。","img":"images/660865/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入保元汤一碗。","img":"images/660865/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将大肉块下入锅里与调味料拌匀。","img":"images/660865/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"在放几块陈皮开大火煮IO分钟转小火炖2小时。","img":"images/660865/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"收汁。","img":"images/660865/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/660865/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}